>>>

<<<
plural, are now reckoned singular. Innings, corps, & some other words in -s, are singular or plural without change of spelling, but, while corps has -s silent in singular & sounded in plural, an innings & several innings show no
===
plural, are now reckoned singular. *Innings, corps,* & some other words in -s, are singular or plural without change of spelling, but, while *corps* has -s silent in singular & sounded in plural, *an innings* & *several innings* show no
